shortdesc A LaTeX template for authors of the Hindawi journals
longdesc This package contains a LaTeX template for authors of the
longdesc Hindawi journals. Authors can use this template for formatting
longdesc their research articles for submissions. The package has been
longdesc created and is maintained by the Typeset team.
